  "description": "French Avenue Pinnace is a bright, refreshing citrus-aromatic fragrance designed for clean, uplifting everyday wear. Introduced in 2024, the scent blends sparkling citrus with cool mint and smooth musky depth for a modern, energetic signature. The opening bursts with vibrant grapefruit and orange, delivering a crisp citrus freshness that feels lively and energizing. The heart introduces refreshing mint and juicy blackcurrant, adding a cool aromatic sweetness. The base settles into ambroxan and musk, creating a smooth, clean finish that feels airy, modern, and easy to wear. Pinnace is perfect for warm weather, daytime wear, and anyone who enjoys fresh citrus fragrances with a clean musky dry down.",
